WEBVTT

00:46:29.146 --> 00:46:31.968
and it will be done with you eventually,

00:46:31.992 --> 00:46:33.922
and when it's done it will leave.

00:46:33.946 --> 00:46:38.528
But to stiffen, to resist, to fight it

00:46:38.552 --> 00:46:40.680
is to hurt yourself.

00:46:40.704 --> 00:46:43.868
And there's this tremendous
psychological and spiritual challenge

00:46:43.892 --> 00:46:49.711
to relax in the awesome power of it
until it's gone through you.

00:46:49.735 --> 00:46:52.239
I've also found, interestingly enough,

00:46:52.263 --> 00:46:55.605
that dance and music help enormously.

00:46:55.629 --> 00:47:00.088
I now have a practice
where I dance every day --